<script setup>import {onMounted,ref} from 'vue';import Card from 'primevue/card';import Tag from 'primevue/tag';import {rpc} from '../../services/supabase';const rows=ref([]);onMounted(async()=>rows.value=await rpc('teacher_gradebook_get'))</script><template><div class="pageHead"><div><h1>คะแนน</h1><p>รายการคะแนนและผลการเรียน</p></div></div><div class="list"><Card v-for="x in rows" :key="x.id"><template #title>{{x.title}}</template><template #subtitle>{{x.category}} • {{x.itemDate}}</template><template #content><div class="score"><b>{{x.maxScore}}</b> คะแนน <Tag :value="`${x.grades?.length||0} คน`"/></div></template></Card></div></template>
